<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-016" chapter-id="c-liangshu-016-yaocha-commentary" source-id="s-liangshu-016-yaocha-commentary-ws1508503">
  <p id="c-liangshu-016-yaocha-commentary:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">陳吏部尚書<persName id="c-liangshu-016-yaocha-commentary:p001:m0005" ref="evj_3wb_3l3_****A*AAA">姚察</persName>曰：孔子稱「殷有三仁：微子去之，箕子爲之奴，<persName id="c-liangshu-016-yaocha-commentary:p001:m0029" ref="xtq_oi8_w82">比干</persName>諫而死。」<persName id="c-liangshu-016-yaocha-commentary:p001:m0036" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA">王亮</persName>之居亂世，勢位見矣。其于取捨，何與三仁之異歟？及奉興王，蒙寬政，爲佐命，固將愧於心。乃自取廢敗，非不幸也。《易》曰：「非所據而據之，身必危。」<persName id="c-liangshu-016-yaocha-commentary:p001:m0109" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA">亮</persName>之進退，失所據矣。惜哉！<persName id="c-liangshu-016-yaocha-commentary:p001:m0122" ref="ant_dk4_dds">張稷</persName>因機制變，亦其時也。<persName id="c-liangshu-016-yaocha-commentary:p001:m0134" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA">王瑩</persName>印章六毀，豈神之害盈乎？</p>
</text>
